  "security": "Guest app/workspace/page/report discovery absent from all after HTTP profiles. Guest Desk APIs denied, bad credentials and invalid Authorization rejected, licensing denial preserved, valid authenticated sessions use normal Desk boot, invalid CSRF rejected. No permission/authentication bypass or global permission cache added.",
  "build_and_cache": "No asset rebuild or migration; no live-site cache flush. Only isolated benchmark cache namespaces were removed.",
  "risks": [
    "The narrow website-settings/boot mirror must be checked on Frappe upgrades; parity regression compares it with standard empty-app context.",
    "A future app installing website_path_resolver hooks needs composition review because Frappe uses the last resolver result.",
    "External OAuth sign-in and LDAP bind were not contacted; their configuration and standard controller/template integration were verified.",
    "TTFB samples describe this local WSGI/DB environment, not reverse-proxy/network/browser performance."
